格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Agent Dashboard: Visualization and analytics for Sessions and Quota Usage. Track, analyze, and optimize token usage across providers with heatmaps, cost tracking, token counting and quota resets..","id":"gh:1166078953","install_available":false,"language":"Python","name":"Tokdash","slug":"JingbiaoMei/Tokdash","topics":["agent","analytics","anthropic","claude-code","claude-code-plugin","codex","codex-cli","dashboard","deepseek-harness","developer-tools","dsh-plugin","kimi-cli","opencode","pi","token-efficiency","token-usage","visualization"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Agent Dashboard: Visualization and analytics for Sessions and Quota Usage. Track, analyze, and optim"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ize token usage across providers with heatmaps, cost tracking, token counting and quota resets.."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"English  |  中文  |  日本語  |  한국어  |  Español  |  Português"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Local token & cost dashboard for AI coding tools"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Try it without installing → tokdash.github.io/demo"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> [!NOTE]\n> **Multiple machines, one dashboard.** Add the Tokdash instances running on WSL, a Mac, o"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"r any other box in Settings: every view combines whatever you select, the Servers tab compares the m"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"achines side by side, and the Quota tab keeps each provider's window bars and reset countdowns group"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"ed per machine. Remote access → · quota tracking →\n>\n> **Also from the same author: Cosyncing.** Syn"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"chronize and control your agents — from CLI to GUI, from desktop to phone. Cosyncing keeps your codi"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"ng agents in sync across your own network."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"That's it. `tokdash setup` detects the runtime, installs a managed one if\nneeded, registers a local "},{"id":"p8s2","text":"service, and prints the dashboard URL —\n`http://127.0.0.1:55423`. Full options, first-run notes, and"},{"id":"p8s3","text":" updates live in\nInstall & run; prefer to look around first? The\nlive demo runs on the real UI."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## One package, four views"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"One local package, one local data index — and four ways to read it. Every surface\nparses the same se"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ssion logs on your own machine, so the browser dashboard, the\nterminal, the menu bar, and your agent"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"'s statusline always agree."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| View | What it is | Reach for it when |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| **WebUI** | The full dashboard: Overview, Sessions, Stats, Report, Quota, Servers | You want the w"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"hole picture, charts, and drill-down |\n| **TUI** | `tokdash tui` — seven panes in the terminal: Over"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"view, Sessions, Stats, Report, Speed, Quota, Pricing | You live in the terminal and want the numbers"},{"id":"p12s4","text":" without a browser |\n| **Companion** | Native menu-bar (macOS) / notification-area (Windows) app | Y"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"ou want today's spend and quota visible all day, dashboard closed |\n| **Statusline** | A live token/"},{"id":"p12s6","text":"cost item inside your agent's statusline | You want the cost ticker exactly where you type |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### WebUI"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"The dashboard is a single page served by the local FastAPI app: exact input /\ncache / output token b"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"reakdowns, per-tool and per-model tables, a contribution\nheatmap, a week/month/year **Report**, per-"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"provider **Quota** windows with reset\ncountdowns, and a **Servers** tab that combines and compares s"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"everal machines.\nClick any screenshot to open the live demo."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Overview"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Usage Report"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Quota tracking"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Multiple servers, one total"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Light and dark follow your OS appearance. The app ships 17 style themes, light/dark modes, PWA insta"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ll, and six UI languages (English / 中文 / 日本語 / 한국어 / Español / Português)."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### Terminal dashboard (TUI)"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Prefer to stay in the terminal? `tokdash tui` opens **seven panes** —\n**Overview**, **Sessions**, **"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"Stats**, **Report**, **Speed**, **Quota** and\n**Pricing** — without a browser, reading the same loca"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"l index (and the shared\non-disk database when a `tokdash serve` is running beside it). `F1`–`F7` jum"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"p\nbetween them, `v` lists them."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"TUI — Overview"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"TUI — Quota"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Keyboard"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| Key | Action |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| `q` | Quit |\n| `r` | Reload the current pane |\n| `F1`–`F7` | Overview / Sessions / Stats / Report "},{"id":"p27s2","text":"/ Speed / Quota / Pricing (`1` / `2` / `3` still jump to Overview / Report / Quota) |\n| `v` | Pick a"},{"id":"p27s3","text":" view from the list |\n| `t` `d` `w` `m` `y` `a` | Set the shared range: today, yesterday, this week,"},{"id":"p27s4","text":" this month, this year, all time |\n| `p` | More ranges (the strip's **More**); on Stats, an earlier "},{"id":"p27s5","text":"year |\n| `P` | Stats: a later year, back up to the trailing 365 days |\n| `c` | Type an exact custom "},{"id":"p27s6","text":"date range |\n| `[` / `]` | Step the range one whole period earlier / later — never into the future |"},{"id":"p27s7","text":"\n| `0` | Back to today |\n| `/` | Search the focused table |\n| `s` | Cycle the sort of the focused ta"},{"id":"p27s8","text":"ble |\n| `enter` / `esc` | Open the selected row / close it |\n| `h` | Choose sources (Sessions and Sp"},{"id":"p27s9","text":"eed) |\n| `H` | Walk Speed's sources one at a time |\n| `k` | Pick the Speed series |\n| `x` | Toggle t"},{"id":"p27s10","text":"he timing set (Speed) |\n| `b` | Cycle the Speed bucket |\n| `u` | Poll quota (Quota pane only) |\n| `?"},{"id":"p27s11","text":"` | Help overlay with all keys |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"One-shot report CLI"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"For a one-shot report you can pipe or script:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"The period is a flag, not a positional argument. Accepted values: `today` (the\ndefault), `week`, `mo"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"nth`, `year`, `all`, a number of days, or `Nd/Nw/Nm/Ny`\nshorthand; `week`, `month` and `year` are th"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"e same calendar-aligned windows the\nweb Report tab shows. `tokdash report` also accepts `--json`, `-"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"-pretty` and\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"- **Exact token counts**: Input/Output/Cache token breakdowns\n- **Session explorer**: per-session dr"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"ill-down\n- **Contribution calendar**: 2D heatmap + 3D isometric view with Tokens/Cost/Messages metri"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"cs\n- **Report tab**: a week / month / year-to-date report of your own agent activity, with a shareab"},{"id":"p33s4","text":"le card for each tier of detail. Every export writes a light and a dark PNG\n- **Quota tab**: subscri"},{"id":"p33s5","text":"ption window bars with reset countdowns for nine providers. Codex windows work out of the box from l"},{"id":"p33s6","text":"ocal logs; most other sources need opt-in live polling\n- **Terminal dashboard** *[new]*: `tokdash tu"},{"id":"p33s7","text":"i` — Overview, Sessions, Stats, Report, Speed, Quota and Pricing in the terminal, no browser require"},{"id":"p33s8","text":"d\n- **Companion status bar app**: spend and subscription quota from the macOS menu bar or Windows no"},{"id":"p33s9","text":"tification area — on the Microsoft Store for Windows\n- **Statusline integration**: a live token-usag"},{"id":"p33s10","text":"e indicator inside Claude Code's statusline (or any agent that can hit a local HTTP endpoint)\n- **Mu"},{"id":"p33s11","text":"lti-server views**: add WSL, macOS, and other Tokdash servers in Settings; combine usage across any "},{"id":"p33s12","text":"selection while keeping quota grouped by machine. See remote access.\n- **Themes and app polish**: 17"},{"id":"p33s13","text":" style themes, light/dark mode, PWA install support, UI in six languages"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Contributing / security"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"- Contributing guide: `docs/CONTRIBUTING.md`\n- Security policy: `docs/SECURITY.md`"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
